  "facts": [
    "The HP Victus 15 features an NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5050 Laptop GPU with 8 GB GDDR7 video memory and an 80 W power limit.",
    "The display is a 15.6-inch Full HD (1920 x 1080) IPS panel with a 144 Hz refresh rate and a matte finish.",
    "Color coverage is limited to approximately 64% sRGB in the Notebookcheck unit and 57% in the LaptopMedia unit.",
    "Screen brightness is approximately 300 nits.",
    "LaptopMedia measured an average of 176 FPS in Counter-Strike 2 at 1080p Very High settings on the RTX 5050 unit.",
    "The laptop supports upgrades via two SO-DIMM DDR5 RAM slots and two M.2 SSD slots.",
    "The Notebookcheck unit shipped with 24 GB RAM and a 512 GB SSD, leaving one RAM slot and one SSD slot free.",
    "Processor options include the Intel Core i5-13420H (Notebookcheck) and AMD Ryzen 5 240 (LaptopMedia).",
    "The AMD Ryzen 5 240 processor can reach temperatures up to 100 C under sustained load.",
    "Notebookcheck described the Intel Core i5-13420H as somewhat outdated.",
    "The chassis is made of plastic that can rattle in places.",
    "The laptop weighs approximately 2.4 kg (5.2 lb) and uses a 200 W power adapter.",
    "Ports include HDMI 2.1, USB-C with DisplayPort 1.4 and power delivery, two USB-A 3.0, RJ45 Ethernet, and an audio jack.",
    "The laptop lacks USB4 and an SD card reader.",
    "The keyboard includes a full numpad but has cramped half-height arrow keys.",
    "The Notebookcheck unit is equipped with Wi-Fi 6 (Realtek RTL8852BE).",
    "Warranty is 12 months in Germany; US warranty terms are not confirmed.",
    "Battery life is approximately 5 hours 44 minutes in LaptopMedia's test.",
    "A 2025 RTX 5060 Victus 15 review measured a battery life of 4 hours 27 minutes.",
    "The HP Victus 15 does not feature an OLED screen, a 240 Hz panel, a high-wattage RTX 5060 or 5070 GPU, or a metal chassis.",
    "HP's premium OMEN gaming line starts at approximately $1,299.",
    "The street price for the Victus 15 with RTX 5050 ranges from approximately $699 to $1,200.",
    "Gaming laptops are reported to be approximately 38% more expensive in early Black Friday 2026 coverage compared to Black Friday 2025.",
    "The assumed Thanksgiving 2026 campaign price is $799 for the Victus 15 with RTX 5050.",
    "The assumed offer period is from Thursday 26 Nov 2026 to Monday 30 Nov 2026.",
    "No claims are made regarding shipping speed, stock levels, financing, free games, or trade-in value."
  ]
